1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,590
I'm getting my nails done!
我居然在修指甲 

2
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:07,030
You said it was going to be fun.
你說會很好玩

3
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:09,730
Which it kind of is.
是有點好玩

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:14,040
You said there would be guys. There are no guys.
你說會有別的男人，哪有啊

5
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,140
There's one right over there.
那邊就有一個 

6
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:18,440
That's a mailman!
那是快遞

7
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,040
That's our mailman!
他也跑我們公司

8
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,840
Hi,how are you....

9
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:31,720
Don't worry. This doesn't make you any less of a guy.
放心 這樣無損於你的男子氣概

10
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:33,720
That does.
那樣會

11
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:37,460
What am I sitting on?
我坐到什麼？

12
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:43,260
What was this woman scratching when this broke off?
這個女人不知道在搔哪裡

13
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:45,610
You know who had nails like that?
你知道誰也戴那種指甲？

14
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,830
Oh...
我…

15
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,230
...my...
的…

16
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,970
...God!
天哪！

17
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:54,980
The One with All the Rugby
本集播出：「調職記」

00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:56,980
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

18
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,590
Joey,let me ask you a question.
喬伊，問你一個問題

19
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,230
What does this light switch do?
我快捉狂了 這個開關是幹嘛用的？

20
00:01:45,430 --> 00:01:46,870
Nothing.
沒用

21
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:49,370
Did it drive you crazy to not know?
你不知道不會捉狂嗎？

22
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:51,600
I know what it did. Nothing.
我知道啊. 它沒用

23
00:01:53,370 --> 00:01:57,110
They put it there for something. How can you not care?
它存在就一定有功用 你怎麼能不在意？

24
00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:58,710
Like this.
就像這樣

25
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:03,440
Here's another question.
還有一個問題

26
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:06,690
What does the silver knob on the toilet do?
你知道馬桶上的把手的功用嗎

27
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,180
It flushes it.
當然知道，沖水

28
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:12,520
Since you know,when you come over, would you use it?
很好，既然你知道，來的時候 請你沖一下好嗎？

30
00:02:15,930 --> 00:02:17,730
-Hello. -Hey.

31
00:02:19,970 --> 00:02:22,800
-Oh,my God. Wow. -Guess who we saw today?
猜我們今天遇見誰

32
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:27,240
-Janice! -ls this amazing?
珍妮絲 很棒吧？

33
00:02:27,740 --> 00:02:30,940
-How have you been? -Well,I'm divorced.
你好嗎？ 我離婚了

34
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,440
Oh,wow.

35
00:02:32,610 --> 00:02:35,980
I'm riding the alimony pony.
正在靠贍養費過活

36
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,920
And there it is.
出現了

37
00:02:41,660 --> 00:02:43,890
I just came up to say "hi."
我只是來打聲招呼，大家好

38
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:47,260
Sweetie,I'll see you later.
親愛的，我們待會見

39
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,090
I'll see you tonight.
晚上見

40
00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:50,660
-Bye. -Bye.
再見，再見…

41
00:02:50,830 --> 00:02:53,160
-Bye. -Bye.

42
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,060
I can't stand the woman!
我受不了那個女人

43
00:02:57,170 --> 00:02:59,940
What? I thought you were crazy about her!
什麼？我以為你愛死她了

44
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:03,840
But you know all those annoying things she did before?
我知道 但是以前她那些很煩的特點

45
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,810
Her voice,her laugh and her personality?
她的聲音、笑聲和個性

46
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,210
They're all back!
全都回來了

47
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:12,580
And she's picked up,like, nine new ones!
而且還多了起碼九種新的

48
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:15,760
Why'd you bring her here? There's people here!
那你幹嘛帶她來？虐待人嘛

49
00:03:17,930 --> 00:03:20,260
Don't worry. I'm taking care of it.
放心，我今晚會搞定

50
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:23,490
You are not! You never break up with her.
會才怪，你一直跟她糾纏不清

51
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,320
I don't have to break up.
這次我不必跟她分手

52
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:28,370
We're not involved. I'll do a preemptive strike.
我們又沒在一起 我會先發制人

53
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:31,500
I'll end it with her before it starts.
我會在開始前就結束掉

54
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:33,940
My ass is,like,frozen!
我的屁股好冰

55
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:39,110
Try sticking it in the freezer for 20 minutes.
塞進冷凍庫20分鐘試試看

56
00:03:42,350 --> 00:03:43,340
I'm telling you!
不要不信

57
00:03:50,690 --> 00:03:53,460
I can't believe you walk alone here at night.
你居然敢晚上自己走在路上

58
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:58,000
-You hear such stories about New York. -It's not that bad.
紐約的傳聞好多 沒那麼嚴重

59
00:03:58,200 --> 00:04:01,130
I mean,l,for one, feel perfectly safe.
我就覺得很安全

60
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,860
Help! Help!
救命啊！救命啊！

61
00:04:06,510 --> 00:04:07,670
No,no,Ross!
羅斯，沒事 

62
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,840
These are friends from home.
他們是我在英國的朋友

63
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,540
Liam,Devon,this is Ross.
連恩，戴文，這是羅斯

64
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:15,580
-Hi,mate. -How are you,man?
老兄 你們好

65
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:19,320
That was a good one,huh? "Help! Help!"
我裝得不錯吧？ 「救命啊！救命啊」

66
00:04:19,990 --> 00:04:20,980
How are you?
你們好嗎？ 

67
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:24,520
I've been meaning to ring you ever since I arrived...
我從一來就想找你們

68
00:04:24,730 --> 00:04:26,460
...but I've been rather busy.
但是…我挺忙的

69
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:29,930
We have not seen each other since that U2 concert.
我們從U2演唱會之後 就沒見過

70
00:04:30,530 --> 00:04:32,330
Oh,my God. You're right.
天哪，沒錯

71
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:36,900
Actually,the last time we saw each other was the next morning.
應該說是演唱會第二天早上

72
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:38,230
Oh,Liam!
連恩

73
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:41,100
Oh,Liam.
連恩

74
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:45,080
So were you guys playing soccer?
你們在打足球？ 

75
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:48,410
Or should I call it "football"?
還是要說「踢」足球？

76
00:04:49,450 --> 00:04:51,180
We were playing rugby.
我們在打橄欖球

77
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:54,720
In fact,we're playing tomorrow. You're welcome to play.
明天就有球賽，歡迎你參加

78
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:57,790
Ross play rugby? I don't think so.
羅斯打橄欖球？不要吧

80
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:01,960
What's so funny?
有什麼可笑的？

81
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:06,360
Well,you're American,to start with. You don't have rugby here.
你是美國人 美國沒有橄欖球

82
00:05:07,900 --> 00:05:12,570
Well,we didn't have freedom here until 1776 either,so....
我們也是到了1776年 才獨立自由

83
00:05:12,810 --> 00:05:15,540
So,good! We'll see you at the park at two.
那好，明天2點公園見 

84
00:05:15,780 --> 00:05:17,210
Cheers!
乾杯

85
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:29,890
Oh,boy! I just love to sing.
天哪，我最喜歡唱歌了

86
00:05:30,290 --> 00:05:31,720
Yes,I know you do.
我知道你喜歡

87
00:05:31,990 --> 00:05:33,650
The reason people complained...
其他人之所以抱怨 

88
00:05:33,930 --> 00:05:38,230
...was because they paid to hear the actor sing "Old Man River."
是因為他們是花錢聽演員唱

89
00:05:38,970 --> 00:05:39,960
Look at us!
你看看我們

90
00:05:40,170 --> 00:05:44,730
Who would've thought Cupid had a station at 14th Street Nails?
想不到在美容院也有愛神駐紮

91
00:05:46,170 --> 00:05:48,010
Okay,we have to talk.
我們得談一談

92
00:05:49,610 --> 00:05:53,480
I'm just getting out of a very serious relationship.
我剛結束一段很認真的戀情

93
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:56,810
I know. And I'm just getting out of a marriage.
我知道，而我剛結束一段婚姻

94
00:05:57,020 --> 00:05:59,750
Talk about "meant to be."
這就叫做三生注定

95
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:04,250
Right. But I think this is happening too soon.
對，但我覺得進展太快了

96
00:06:04,530 --> 00:06:07,090
Oh,too soon,too schmoon!
什麼太快，是太慢

97
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:11,270
Face it,I'm not letting you get away this time.
認命吧，這次我不會放過你的

98
00:06:12,030 --> 00:06:13,630
I hear you!
我聽見了

99
00:06:16,870 --> 00:06:17,860
But...
但是

100
00:06:18,110 --> 00:06:19,330
...unfortunately...
很不幸的

101
00:06:19,610 --> 00:06:21,170
...my company...
我的公司 

102
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:23,710
...is transferring me overseas.
要把我調到海外

103
00:06:25,650 --> 00:06:27,270
Oh,no!
不會吧

104
00:06:28,050 --> 00:06:29,540
Where to?
調去哪裡？

105
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,880
To Paris?
巴黎？ 

106
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,610
No,not Paris.
不，不是巴黎

107
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:36,520
To London? Rome? Vienna?
倫敦？羅馬？維也納？

108
00:06:36,690 --> 00:06:37,720
Barcelona?
巴塞隆納？

109
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:40,660
Could you just stop talking for a second?
你先別講話好嗎？

110
00:06:43,030 --> 00:06:44,730
Yemen.
葉門

111
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:50,400
That's right. Yes! I'm being transferred to Yemen!
對，沒錯，我要被調去葉門

112
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:51,900
When?
什麼時候？

113
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,730
I don't know exactly.
我不太清楚

114
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:59,210
Well,I will just have to soak up every ounce...
那我只好細細品嚐 

115
00:06:59,410 --> 00:07:04,080
...of Chandler Bing until that moment comes.
錢德賓的一切 直到那一刻來臨

117
00:07:05,350 --> 00:07:07,910
But I do know it's sometime tomorrow.
但我知道是明天某時

118
00:07:12,530 --> 00:07:14,090
-Done? -Yep!
好了？ 對

119
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:17,220
What's up?
幹什麼？

120
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:19,260
This switch is driving me crazy.
這個開關快把我逼瘋了

121
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,930
I turned it off and checked every outlet.
所以我把它關掉 檢查每個插座

122
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:26,200
Four don't work,which means one is controlled by the switch.
有四個不能用 表示其中一個由它控制

123
00:07:26,410 --> 00:07:30,000
So I plugged things in the outlets that make noise.
所以我插上會發出聲音的東西

124
00:07:30,210 --> 00:07:33,840
That way,when I turn it on, I just follow the noise.
到時候一打開 順著聲音去找就行了

125
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,510
Bet I stopped listening first.
我一定會第一個放棄

126
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:42,120
You know,you also could have used lamps...
你可以插電燈

127
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,790
...and followed the light.
然後找燈光

128
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:47,090
Yeah,well,I'm using noise.
我要找聲音

129
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,390
So,everybody ready?
準備好了嗎？

130
00:07:51,130 --> 00:07:52,790
Here we go!
開咯

131
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:58,640
Something. I hear something. Where is it?
有聲音，我聽到了，在哪裡？

132
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:11,740
It's coming from Joey!
是喬伊發出來的

133
00:08:13,450 --> 00:08:16,620
Oh,my God! That's so freaky! Turn him off!
天哪，好詭異喔，把他關掉！

134
00:08:25,670 --> 00:08:28,790
Could we put on the news? It might be raining.
可以看新聞嗎？可能在下雨

135
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:33,440
Hold on. I'm watching this rugby thing on ESPN.
等一下 我在看ESPN的橄欖球賽

136
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:36,510
I'm man enough to play this sport!
了不起啊，我也能打

137
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:40,940
You're not even man enough to get the channel that carries the sport.
你家連運動台都沒有

138
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,580
Hey there,Ross!
羅斯

139
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:48,250
Janice.
是珍妮絲

140
00:08:50,660 --> 00:08:54,190
You know,you really didn't have to help me pack.
你真的不必幫我打包

141
00:08:54,530 --> 00:08:58,660
When you said all you'd be doing before you leave is packing...
你說你出發之前都要打包 

142
00:08:58,870 --> 00:09:01,330
...you really didn't leave me much choice.
我還有什麼選擇

143
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:04,100
I thought I did, but I guess I did not.
我以為有，看來是沒有

144
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,600
What's going on?
怎麼回事？

145
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:12,340
I'm packing,you know, because I'm moving to Yemen tomorrow.
我要打包 因為我明天要搬去葉門

146
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,870
Thanks for telling me!
謝謝你告訴我啊

147
00:09:17,690 --> 00:09:21,490
I'm going to be pretend-moving to Yemen. To get rid of her.
我是假裝要搬去葉門 好擺脫她

148
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:23,780
Good one!
漂亮

149
00:09:25,490 --> 00:09:28,890
Yemen! That actually sounds like a real country!
葉門，聽起來還真像個國家

150
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:34,090
I'll show you how to roll your underwear and stuff it in your shoes.
錢德，快來 我教你怎麼把內衣褲塞進鞋子

151
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,560
It's a space-saver.
可以省空間

152
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:38,630
I do that because it makes me look taller.
我那樣做是想墊高

153
00:09:41,740 --> 00:09:42,970
Come on!
錢德，來啊 好

154
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:47,010
-Joey,trade lives with me. -Nope.
喬伊，跟我交換人生 不要

155
00:09:49,050 --> 00:09:51,680
Ross,I can't believe you said you'd play.
天哪，你看看 羅斯，你居然說你要打

156
00:09:51,890 --> 00:09:52,980
This is brutal!
這種運動好野蠻 

157
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:54,740
I can handle it.
我可以應付

158
00:09:54,990 --> 00:09:59,590
Please,Ross. You got hurt playing badminton with my dad.
拜託 你連跟我爸打羽毛球都會受傷

159
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:03,990
That's because your mom's dog kept looking at me.
那是因為你媽的狗一直看我

160
00:10:06,330 --> 00:10:08,860
Look! Right here, it's called a "scrum."
好，你看，這個叫鬥牛陣 

161
00:10:09,070 --> 00:10:10,500
It's like a huddle.
就像聚商

162
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:13,260
And is a hum like a scruddle?
那商斗就像聚牛陣嗎？

163
00:10:14,610 --> 00:10:17,080
Ross,they're going kill you!
羅斯，他們會宰了你

164
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:20,880
Why are you doing this,anyway?
你為什麼要打？

165
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,540
You should've seen the guy she used to date.
你們應該看看她以前交往的人

166
00:10:24,850 --> 00:10:26,880
He's like "Joe Rugby"!
他活像顆大橄欖球

167
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:30,350
You're kidding! And he plays rugby? That's funny!
不會吧，而他又打橄欖球？ 好好玩

168
00:10:32,390 --> 00:10:34,520
Oh,I see. You did that.
我懂你的意思了

169
00:10:36,230 --> 00:10:40,460
She thought the very idea of me playing rugby was hilarious.
總之她覺得我打橄欖球很好笑

170
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:43,190
So I'll show her how tough I really am.
所以我要證明我有多猛

171
00:10:46,710 --> 00:10:49,040
I'm sorry. You are a tough guy.
對不起，你說得對，你是很猛

172
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:51,540
The toughest paleontologist I know.
你是我認識最猛的古生物學家

173
00:10:52,980 --> 00:10:56,710
Ross can take care of himself. It's not like he's Chandler.
沒問題啦，羅斯會照顧自己 他又不是錢德 

174
00:10:56,950 --> 00:10:58,380
Thanks.
謝了

175
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,620
Don't worry about me.
別替我擔心

176
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:04,380
I'll just look energetic and stay away from the ball.
我會裝得很有衝勁 跟球保持距離

177
00:11:04,590 --> 00:11:07,560
I'll be that guy, right outside the circle.
我會學那個人站在外面

178
00:11:13,470 --> 00:11:16,060
Maybe there was a dog looking at him.
也許有狗在看他

179
00:11:27,010 --> 00:11:29,140
Stay away from that guy and that guy...
羅斯，別靠近那個人、那個人 

180
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:32,280
...and that one. Dude,they're all huge!
和那個人 他們都好壯

181
00:11:33,850 --> 00:11:35,450
They're no bigger than me.
又沒比我壯

182
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:40,680
You're closer to you. So you look bigger to you from where you are.
你離你比較近 所以看你自己比較壯

183
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:43,730
I'm going to go say "hello."
我去跟他們打個招呼 

184
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:54,130
I kind of liked it.
還蠻可愛的

185
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,040
I know what to do.
我知道了

186
00:11:58,250 --> 00:12:00,580
I've got to go Red Ross.
我要變成赤面羅斯

187
00:12:01,620 --> 00:12:03,340
You know,Red Ross?
赤面羅斯啊

188
00:12:04,150 --> 00:12:05,850
Totally don't know.
完全給他不知道

189
00:12:06,090 --> 00:12:09,350
That time we were in line for Dances With Wolves...
那次我們去看「與狼共舞」

190
00:12:09,590 --> 00:12:13,250
...and that guy cut in front of us and I just lost it?
有人插隊，我不是就捉狂了？

191
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:15,990
Screamed at him,turned all red!
破口大罵，臉都漲紅了

192
00:12:16,430 --> 00:12:18,090
Red Ross!
赤面羅斯啊

193
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:23,070
You'll see!
等著瞧

194
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:26,000
Liam,do me a favor.
連恩，幫個忙

195
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:29,400
Go easy on Ross. It's his first time.
對羅斯手下留情 他是第一次打

196
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,340
You don't say?
是嗎？

197
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,120
Good luck,babe.
加油

198
00:12:43,590 --> 00:12:45,150
Come on,get in here!
老弟，快進來

199
00:12:46,990 --> 00:12:47,980
Come on!
快點

200
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:58,470
Come on,get in the bloody scrum!
羅斯，快進來爭球

201
00:12:58,670 --> 00:13:00,110
Ross,get in!
羅斯，進去

202
00:13:11,950 --> 00:13:13,040
Joey!
喬伊

203
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:20,650
You're not going to believe it! Joshua came in today,and guess what?
說了你一定不信 約書亞今天來，你猜怎樣？

204
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:22,230
He asked you out?
他約你？ 沒有

205
00:13:22,460 --> 00:13:26,400
But I showed him some cuff links, and I felt his pulse.
不過我給他看一些袖扣 結果摸到他的脈搏

206
00:13:28,470 --> 00:13:29,870
Saucy!
卯死了

207
00:13:31,310 --> 00:13:34,870
-What are these? -Electrical plans for the building.
這是什麼？ 這棟樓的電路圖

208
00:13:36,410 --> 00:13:37,880
Okay,should I be scared?
我應該被嚇到嗎？

209
00:13:39,150 --> 00:13:43,010
I know that switch does something. I got these from City Hall.
那個開關一定有作用 這是去市政府調的

210
00:13:43,220 --> 00:13:45,980
I just paid $25 and waited for three hours.
只花了25元，排了3小時

211
00:13:47,250 --> 00:13:49,590
Wow! If only more people knew!
可惜大家不知道

212
00:13:53,730 --> 00:13:56,630
All right,do you understand any of this?
你看得懂嗎？

213
00:13:56,800 --> 00:14:00,130
No,I don't understand any of this electrical stuff.
我對水電的事一竅不通

214
00:14:00,300 --> 00:14:03,200
All right,does this look like a switch?
這看起來像開關嗎？ 

215
00:14:03,370 --> 00:14:04,860
I don't know.
我不知道

216
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:06,630
-ls this wiring? -I don't know.
這是線路嗎？ 我不知道

217
00:14:07,140 --> 00:14:09,700
That looks like a bunny though.
不過這個像小白兔

218
00:14:12,818 --> 00:14:15,150
「葉門航空」

219
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:24,050
You really didn't have to take me to the airport.
你實在不必送我來機場

220
00:14:24,330 --> 00:14:27,320
Oh,please. Every moment is precious.
拜託，每分每秒都很珍貴

221
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:30,530
Besides,someone had to ride with your luggage.
況且總得有人幫你提行李

222
00:14:30,730 --> 00:14:34,000
And your friends don't seem to care that you're leaving.
你朋友好像都不關心你要走了

223
00:14:34,770 --> 00:14:36,430
We're not that close.
我們其實沒那麼要好

224
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:41,600
Okay. So I guess this is goodbye then.
好，那就再見了

225
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:43,240
Oh,no!
不

226
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:47,510
It's not goodbye. I'm not leaving till you get on that plane.
還沒呢 你上了飛機我才要走

227
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:51,120
Okay. Well,I guess it's just "wait here" then.
好，那就「請在此等候」

228
00:14:54,290 --> 00:14:56,450
I need a fake ticket to Yemen.
我要一張去葉門的假機票

229
00:14:57,790 --> 00:14:58,780
One ticket?
一張去葉門的機票？ 不是

230
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:02,850
I just need a pretend ticket.
我只需要一張假機票

231
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:05,100
I'm sorry. I don't understand.
抱歉，我不懂

232
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:08,230
Okay,what would you give a kid to play with?
好，你會拿什麼給小朋友玩？

233
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:10,700
Are you traveling with a child?
您有帶小孩子？

234
00:15:12,070 --> 00:15:13,840
No.
沒有

235
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:18,110
She'll think I'm handing you a credit card.
她會以為我在拿信用卡給你

236
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:22,150
But what I'll really hand you is a library card.
其實我拿的是借書證

237
00:15:23,580 --> 00:15:28,250
A ticket to Yemen is $2100, and we don't take library cards.
去葉門的機票是2100元 我們不收借書證

238
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:31,320
What's the matter? Is something wrong?
怎麼了？有什麼問題嗎？

239
00:15:31,930 --> 00:15:33,450
Do you have to stay?
你得留下來嗎？

240
00:15:35,130 --> 00:15:36,860
American Express?
美國運通卡？

241
00:15:46,970 --> 00:15:50,970
I can't believe they're doing that! I told them to go easy on him!
他們怎麼這樣 我明明叫他們手下留情

242
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:55,810
No offense,but sometimes it's hard to understand you,with the accent.
我沒有惡意 但有時你的口音很難懂

243
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:59,850
That's just halftime. There's more.
才上半場結束，還有下半場

244
00:16:02,660 --> 00:16:03,650
Did you see me?
你們看到了嗎？

245
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:07,360
I was pretty good. That is one fun game!
我挺強的 好過癮的球賽

247
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,320
Do me a favor? Grab me some water?
幫個忙，幫我拿點水

248
00:16:10,660 --> 00:16:11,650
Thanks!
謝謝

249
00:16:14,130 --> 00:16:15,970
I think I'm dying. I really do.
我覺得我快死了，真的

250
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,260
Poor baby!
真可憐 

251
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:19,200
Tell my son that I love him.
告訴我兒子我愛他

252
00:16:20,740 --> 00:16:23,940
Excellent! Got to have some more fun!
太好了，我還要再打個過癮

253
00:16:24,210 --> 00:16:25,800
They are killing you.
羅斯，你快被整死了

254
00:16:27,550 --> 00:16:28,570
That's not true.
亂講

255
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:30,650
She's right. You have to stop!
她說得對，你不能再打了

256
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,910
No! I'm not stopping. I'm Red Ross!
不行，我是赤面羅斯

257
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:37,320
Dude,you go back out there, you'll be Dead Ross.
你再上場會變成屎面羅斯

258
00:16:37,590 --> 00:16:40,720
I'm not quitting. I'm going to finish this game.
我絕不退場，我要打完

259
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:43,930
If you insist on it, at least let me help you.
好，如果你一定要打 至少讓我幫忙

260
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:48,100
It's no place for a woman. Those guys will grab anything!
不行，這不是女人玩的 那些人什麼都捉

261
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:53,930
That's not it. I just know a few things that can help you inflict pain.
我不是要上場 我只是知道怎樣讓別人受傷

262
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,730
I like that.
我喜歡 是嗎？

263
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,470
Listen closely.
聽好

264
00:16:57,680 --> 00:16:59,740
Devon has got a weak ankle.
戴文的腳踝很弱

265
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:02,010
One swift kick and he'll back off.
踢一下就會倒

266
00:17:02,250 --> 00:17:03,910
Bad ankle. Got it!
好，腳踝虛，瞭解

267
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:08,320
And that big bloke with the beard? He's got a trick hip.
那個留落腮鬍的大個子 腰部毛病很多

268
00:17:08,760 --> 00:17:11,820
And David over there, he doesn't wear a cup.
那邊的大衛沒穿護襠

269
00:17:12,430 --> 00:17:15,420
I could use that. Trick hip,no cup. Okay!
蠻有用的，腰不好 沒穿護襠，好

270
00:17:15,630 --> 00:17:20,430
And Liam's got bad knees. Hit him right and he'll go down like a lamp.
連恩的膝蓋不好 看準了一撞就倒

271
00:17:20,670 --> 00:17:22,360
But Liam's on my team.
但是連恩跟我同隊

272
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:25,610
-I don't care. Just get him! -Go and get him!
我不管，你去宰了他 好，宰了他

273
00:17:26,370 --> 00:17:28,340
I am going back in!
我要回場上了

274
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:33,970
Red Ross! Yeah!
赤面羅斯

275
00:17:43,860 --> 00:17:44,880
What are these?
這些是什麼？

276
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:48,390
Just some pictures I made and hung up.
我畫了一些畫掛起來

277
00:17:48,700 --> 00:17:51,860
I thought they'd brighten up the place. Don't they?
好讓客廳看起來更漂亮 有用吧？

278
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:56,590
No,don't.

279
00:18:00,670 --> 00:18:04,010
There's no hole there. I just really like that picture.
那裡沒有洞 我只是很喜歡那幅畫

280
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:09,010
Oh,my God! Look at this!
天哪，你看看

281
00:18:09,250 --> 00:18:12,690
But there is a wire there! It's connected to something!
但是那邊有電線 一定連到某個地方

282
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:16,750
I don't care! The wires have come loose in your head!
我不管，你才是腦筋脫線了

283
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:20,250
If I could follow the wire, I'd find out what it did.
順著電線就能找出它的功用

284
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:21,450
And did you?
那你找到了嗎？ 

285
00:18:21,660 --> 00:18:22,690
No.
沒有

286
00:18:23,730 --> 00:18:25,860
It disappears behind there.
到了地板上就斷了

287
00:18:26,330 --> 00:18:29,230
For a minute,I thought it went downstairs.

288
00:18:31,810 --> 00:18:33,330
Say hello to Mrs. Catrokis.
跟凱卓奇斯太太打招呼

289
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:36,940
-Hello,darling. -Hello,Mrs. Catrokis.
妹妹你好 凱卓奇斯太太你好

290
00:18:37,180 --> 00:18:39,980
Hey,Mrs. Catrokis,do you know Kenny?
凱卓奇斯太太，你認識肯尼嗎

291
00:18:40,450 --> 00:18:43,280
You have got to be kid Wow!
不會吧

292
00:18:48,790 --> 00:18:50,920
Are you sure you don't want a doctor?
你真的不去看醫生？

293
00:18:51,190 --> 00:18:54,130
No,that'll just bring me down!
不要，那樣我會直接掛掉

294
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:58,590
This was great! I was great! This was a great day!
太棒了 我太厲害了，今天真過癮

295
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:01,060
I'm buying everyone coffee.
我請大家喝咖啡

296
00:19:01,370 --> 00:19:03,960
Just grab my wallet. It's in my pocket.
幫我拿皮夾，在我的口袋裡

297
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,640
No,not you.
不是你

298
00:19:06,970 --> 00:19:10,640
Your eye's still popping out. I'll go get some ice.
你的眼睛還是突的 我去拿冰塊

299
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:13,470
Ice,yeah! I'm so in the mood for ice.
好 冰塊，我正想吃冰塊

300
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:17,580
You were amazing out there.
你剛才好神勇

301
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:19,640
I kind of was,wasn't l?
還蠻神勇的吧？ 開玩笑

302
00:19:19,890 --> 00:19:20,880
Oh,my God!

303
00:19:21,090 --> 00:19:24,790
I made a man twice my size cry!
我讓一個壯我兩倍的人哭了

304
00:19:25,330 --> 00:19:30,160
I haven't done that since I was four and I washed my dad's Porsche with rocks.
上一次是4歲 我用石頭洗我爸的保時捷

305
00:19:31,730 --> 00:19:34,170
You really enjoyed yourself, didn't you?
你真的打得很過癮對不對？

306
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,890
Are you kidding? I hurt three huge men.
開玩笑，我幹掉三個大塊頭 

307
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:39,000
I gave a guy a bloody nose!
還讓一個人流鼻血

308
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:41,330
I'm not proud of it...
這沒什麼好得意的

309
00:19:42,410 --> 00:19:43,810
...but I really am!
不過…我真的好得意

310
00:19:45,310 --> 00:19:47,250
And it's all because of you.
都是因為你

311
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:52,140
-Wonderful,amazing you. -I think you've got a concussion.
最棒最棒的你 我看你是腦震盪了

312
00:19:52,420 --> 00:19:54,940
No,I'm serious. Thank you.
不，我是說真的，謝謝你

313
00:19:56,190 --> 00:19:58,160
You're welcome.
不客氣

314
00:20:00,330 --> 00:20:02,190
I'm sorry. Did that hurt you?
對不起，會痛嗎？

315
00:20:02,430 --> 00:20:03,490
It's worth the pain.
痛也值得

316
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:07,430
You know what? It's not.
其實不值得

317
00:20:12,810 --> 00:20:16,800
This is the final boarding call for flight 664 to Yemen.
最後一次呼叫前往葉門的旅客

318
00:20:20,010 --> 00:20:22,210
Well,I guess I gotta go.
看來我該走了

319
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:24,340
My Bing-a-ling.
我的賓淇淋

320
00:20:26,820 --> 00:20:28,190
I'll wait for you.
我會等你的

321
00:20:28,390 --> 00:20:30,480
How long will you be gone?
你要去多久？

322
00:20:31,390 --> 00:20:36,230
Well,just until we find an energy source to replace fuel.
直到找出可以替代石油的能源

323
00:20:39,170 --> 00:20:41,030
I'll write you every day.
我會每天寫信給你

324
00:20:41,370 --> 00:20:44,460
15 Yemen Road,Yemen.
葉門葉門路15號

325
00:20:46,170 --> 00:20:48,160
Okay. Goodbye.
好，再見

326
00:21:03,695 --> 00:21:06,330
錢德，錢德

327
00:21:06,730 --> 00:21:10,160
Janice! There you are! I had to have one last kiss.
珍妮絲，你在這裡 我得跟你做最後吻別

328
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:13,820
And also,you said you'd leave after I got on the plane!
另外你也說我一上機你就要走

329
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:18,260
No. I want to see you take off.
不，我想看著你起飛

330
00:21:19,010 --> 00:21:21,440
Well,then I guess I'm going to Yemen.
那我要去葉門羅

331
00:21:23,280 --> 00:21:25,180
I'm going to Yemen!
我要去葉門了

332
00:21:26,610 --> 00:21:29,950
When we get to Yemen, can I stay with you?
到了葉門，我可以住你家嗎？

333
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:39,520
All right. The super couldn't figure out what it did.
好，管理員不知道它的作用

334
00:21:39,730 --> 00:21:43,130
The $200-an-hour electrician couldn't figure out what it did.
1小時2百的電工 不曉得它的作用

335
00:21:43,330 --> 00:21:46,390
I've had seven pretty serious shocks.
我被狠狠電到七次

336
00:21:47,330 --> 00:21:48,820
I give up.
我放棄了 

337
00:21:49,040 --> 00:21:50,970
Thank God.
謝天謝地

338
00:21:51,410 --> 00:21:53,070
I guess Joey was right.
看來喬伊說得對

339
00:21:54,010 --> 00:21:55,770
It does nothing.
它沒有用

340
00:22:00,780 --> 00:22:02,180
See?
你看

341
00:22:06,820 --> 00:22:09,580
I'm doing it! I am totally doing it!
是我弄的，真的是我弄的

342
00:22:16,830 --> 00:22:18,200
I lost it.
超能力沒了

343
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000